<BaseLayout
  title="Editorial Team | wrongfulterminationcalc.com"
  description="Meet the editorial team behind WrongfulTerminationCalc."
>

  <h1>Our Editorial Team</h1>

  <p>
    Every article, guide, and calculator on WrongfulTerminationCalc is written or reviewed by our editorial team before publication. We do not publish content that has not been reviewed for legal and factual accuracy.
  </p>

  <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
  <p>
    WrongfulTerminationCalc follows strict editorial standards to maintain accuracy and independence:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>All legal content is reviewed by our editorial team before publication.</li>
    <li>Statutory information, case citations, and EEOC data are verified against primary sources.</li>
    <li>Content is updated when significant legal developments (new statutes, major court decisions, regulatory changes) affect accuracy.</li>
    <li>We do not accept payment to alter editorial content. Our monetization is through display advertising only.</li>
    <li>We clearly distinguish between factual information and educational estimates. Our calculator results are estimates, not legal advice.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    If you believe any content on this site contains an error, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>. We take accuracy seriously and correct verified errors promptly.
  </p>

</BaseLayout>
